{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">無綫節目《阿爺廚房》中，李家鼎（鼎爺）曾示範炮製足料的「椰菜瑤柱海皇湯」。這款靚湯集結了瑤柱、蠔豉、章魚乾及蝦乾等多款海味精華，再加入鮮蝦與椰菜熬煮。湯頭喝起來不但鮮甜濃郁，海味獨有的鹹香更與椰菜的清甜交織，口感鮮美且層次極豐富。只需跟足鼎爺的處理步驟與火候，在家也能輕鬆重現這道滋潤靚湯！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"f1026945-7c74-4e8e-9c9d-f5751e6a463a.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026lBMGwWph0A1784779169.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"f1026945-7c74-4e8e-9c9d-f5751e6a463a.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><strong>所需材料（份量因人而異）</strong></p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">章魚乾</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">鮮蝦</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">椰菜</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">冬菇</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">蝦乾</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">瑤柱</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">蠔豉</p></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><strong>煮食步驟</strong></p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ol><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"55080287-8488-4785-8b95-25e87af0f161.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026hOXLjZIXvB1784779173.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"55080287-8488-4785-8b95-25e87af0f161.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-25T11:20:16.395585+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":185,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}